  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Slip into comfort with our “Mea” Logo Shorts Set!<br>This body-hugging duo was made for movement and style. Featuring high-waisted shorts with our bold logo across the back and a matching zip-up jacket, this set brings a sporty edge to your everyday look. Crafted from a soft, stretchy nylon-spandex blend, it keeps you comfy while showing off your curves.</p>\n<p>Perfect for lounging, errands, or a casual day out — this is athleisure done right.</p>\n<p>Fabric: 75% Nylon / 25% Spandex</p>",
